        <guid isPermaLink="false">tien-kou-https://tien-kou.shunf4.workers.dev/-e1-guarded/SlipBox/2025-10-24 00.43.26</guid>
        <pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 00:43:26 +0800</pubDate>
        <description><![CDATA[
<div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq asset-info-line"><a target="_blank" class="secondary" href="/SlipBox">SlipBox</a> / <a href="/SlipBox/2025-10-24%2000.43.26">2025-10-24 00.43.26</a> <span>2025-10-24 00:43:26 UTC+8</span></div>
</div>

      
          <div class="group-asset"><div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-CN"><p>好了，花了一晚上把之前工作过的Easy7-Zip-SF直接rebase干上了最新版25.01，再也不用管什么NanaZip和PeaZip了。</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/shunf4/Easy7-Zip-SF" target="_blank">https://github.com/shunf4/Easy7-Zip-SF</a></p>


</div>
</div>
</div>

          </div>
      <div class="one-in-seq-wrapper">
    <div class="one-in-seq asset-info-line">// <a target="_blank" class="secondary" href="/SlipBox">SlipBox</a> / <a href="/SlipBox/2025-10-22%2010.24.31">2025-10-22 10.24.31</a> <span>2025-10-22 10:24:31 UTC+8</span></div>
    <div class="one-in-seq principal-content">
<div class="lang-wrapper" lang="zh-CN"><p>即使是NanaZip，相对于原版7-Zip的体验也有降级（启动速度；文件关联设置；以及所有的对话框都只在主显示器位置弹出而不是当前显示器），真不知道代码基是一样的为什么会改成这样。更别提PeaZip这个打开等几秒的了…</p>
<p>7-Zip有一点不好：默认宋体，之后看有没有办法改</p>


</div>
</div>
</div>

        ]]></description>
      </item>
